status GREEN -- amphora_ferried_body_proven and 14 sibling amphora witnesses on metal, tame_style_check, width-check, ascii_comment and rye_spoken_ascii GREEN, readme_metrics GREEN standing still, standing_equipment's roster_broken closed by the guard landing. The cold open went void at tree_moved=yes when my own round-open stashed a finished round mid-pass; the HOT CLOSE over exactly what ships reads 238 green, 0 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no, run_verdict=ok -- the whole roster clean, and the two reds the void pass named both closed.
recommend keep-going -- the ferry's walk still counts without a ceiling, and it wants a measurement of how many bodies a real resins home holds rather than a lap's invented number
